{"track":"r","category":"벡터·문자열","level":2,"title":"제곱 수열","desc":"<p>1², 2², …, n²을 담은 벡터를 돌려주는 <code>seq_squares(n)</code>을 만드세요. <code>n</code>이 0이면 빈 벡터예요.</p>","solution":"seq_squares <- function(n) {\n  seq_len(n)^2\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>1:n</code> 은 n이 0일 때 <code>c(1, 0)</code> 이 되는 함정이 있어요. <code>seq_len(n)</code> 을 쓰세요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"seq_squares(3)","expected":[1,4,9],"visible":true},{"call":"seq_squares(0)","expected":[],"visible":true},{"call":"seq_squares(2)","expected":[1,4],"visible":false},{"call":"seq_squares(5)","expected":[1,4,9,16,25],"visible":false}],"starter":"seq_squares <- function(n) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-320"}